#: archivedialog.cpp:84
msgid ""
"The age of the appointments to archive. All older appointments will be saved "
"and deleted, the newer will be kept."
msgstr ""
"Oed yr apwyntiadau i'w archifo.  Cedwir a dileuir pob apwyntiad hyn, gadewir "
"y rhai newyddach."

#: archivedialog.cpp:92
